---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="공학 계산기 허브 | EngCalc Hub"
  description="전기 및 기계 엔지니어를 위한 정확하고 빠른 무료 공학 계산기 모음."
>
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 text-center">
    <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 uppercase bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 rounded-full border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900">
      현장 엔지니어를 위한 고정밀 계산 도구
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
      엔지니어링 <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">계산기 허브</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      서버 통신 없이 브라우저에서 0ms로 즉각 연산되는 순수 클라이언트 기반 계산기입니다.
    </p>

    <!-- Calculator Cards Grid -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left">
      <!-- 1. Battery Runtime -->
      <a href="/calculators/battery-runtime" class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-500 dark:hover:border-blue-500 transition duration-200">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/50 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold mb-4">
          🔋
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-blue-600 dark:group-hover:text-blue-400 transition">
          배터리 런타임 계산기
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          포이케르트 법칙(Peukert's law)과 방전 심도(DoD), 인버터 효율을 반영하여 실제 가용 시간을 계산합니다.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 group-hover:underline">
          계산기 바로가기 &rarr;
        </span>
      </a>

      <!-- 2. Voltage Drop -->
      <a href="/calculators/voltage-drop" class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-500 dark:hover:border-blue-500 transition duration-200">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold mb-4">
          ⚡
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-amber-600 dark:group-hover:text-amber-400 transition">
          케이블 전압 강하 계산기
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          직류(DC), 단상 교류, 3상 선로의 전압 강하율과 전력 손실을 산출하고 권장 케이블 규격(sq)을 제시합니다.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 group-hover:underline">
          계산기 바로가기 &rarr;
        </span>
      </a>

      <!-- 3. Motor Sizing -->
      <a href="/calculators/motor-torque" class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-500 dark:hover:border-blue-500 transition duration-200">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/50 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-4">
          ⚙️
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition">
          모터 토크 및 출력 계산기
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          회전수(RPM)와 토크(Nm) 또는 출력(kW, HP, 마력) 간의 공학적 상호 변환을 간편하게 연산합니다.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 group-hover:underline">
          계산기 바로가기 &rarr;
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
